<title>UK: Southend airport traffic down in June.</title>
<headline>Southend airport traffic down in June.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air cargo flown into London's small Southend airport in June totalled 10,940 tonnes against 12,018 tonmnes in June last year, the latest airport activity report shows.</p>
<p>But in the financial year starting April flown tonnage of 37,977 tonnes was up on last year's figure.</p>
<p>Details in tonnes include</p>
<p>Air Cargo		Jun 97   Jun 96  Apr-Jun 97  Apr-June 96</p>
<p>Imports Flown	  10,940   12,018   37,977	35,737</p>
<p>Imports trucked</p>
<p>From L/HROW &amp; LGW     8,881	559   52,045	 4,415</p>
<p>Other Road</p>
<p>Imports			 0   22,000	  0	27,316</p>
<p>Storage Space	   1,168	 92	n/a	   n/a</p>
<p>Occupied (m3)</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
</text>
